{"author":{"id":"b409816c5cd5ab140d1d52eb33aace35de44952bb794b19806fd57f6ecb1ace9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1793641942,"nonce":"3aumAi4JW40uboqrbEO/OjdzPTg=","title":"str.split() walks one character at a time and misses Unicode whitespace","message":"zb_str_split_ws (zyntax_builtins/src/lists.rs) makes three plugin calls per character (zb_str_char_at_byte, zb_str_is_space with four string comparisons, zb_str_next_byte). It treats only space, tab, LF and CR as whitespace.\n\nPerf: ('alpha beta gamma delta ' * 50000).split() takes about 65 ms zypy vs 6 ms CPython and PyPy.\nCorrectness: 'a\\x0bb\\x0cc d'.split() and 'a\\u00a0b\\u2003c d'.split() return 2 fields; CPython returns 4 (\\x0b, \\x0c, \\x1c-\\x1f, \\x85, NBSP and Unicode spaces are whitespace).\n\nDirection: byte loop over the string data with a whitespace table, decoding UTF-8 only for non-ASCII.","files":null}]}